    "focus": "Fix ISSUE-76b6e6635afe5530 (docs/standalone/name-phase-field-when-design-review-E2026110576b6e663/ISSUE.md): a malformed design review request is refused with a message naming its phase and the first offending field; an unknown or missing phase lists the valid phases; code invalid_schema and class DesignReviewInputError unchanged; valid requests stay valid.",
