    "summary": "parseDesignRequest keeps the union check; when it fails with invalid_schema, refuseUnmatchedRequest picks the schema by the request's phase and refuses with '<phase> request: <path>: <message>', or with 'phase: Expected one of …' for an unknown or missing phase. Code invalid_schema and class DesignReviewInputError unchanged; valid requests unchanged. One new test in recovery-contracts.test.ts (fails without the fix); the 82 design-review tests pass. Left out: parts 1 and 3 of #101.",
